            "group_id": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "After an arbor is inserted into the spindle hole, a DIAL INDICATOR is fastened to it and adjusted so that the button is in contact with the top of the table. The average reading is noted as the table is moved back and forth under the button of the instrument.",
